{"title":"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Partly_Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Partly Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a6136b39cb1f78af0aea1beb8126758378a4b730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;b&lt;2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />, form a geometric sequence with an integer ratio. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/1/6311a252212c7ac1df3b0b3b5a5c610fccabed09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 41 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 49 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 289 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"405\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7fe945f7e6667bbd8ad2e1fd17d10ec3fdde573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009 = 7\\cdot 7\\cdot 41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"122\" height=\"13\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a6136b39cb1f78af0aea1beb8126758378a4b730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;b&lt;2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />, the ratio must be positive and larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, hence there is only one possibility: the ratio must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1e93ad048d8f66cc3d604619ce3cd3e8c4ee419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=7\\cdot 41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/8/33899975156f027e48a049f25de2dae768707588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=41\\Rightarrow\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>We know that this is important because the complete equation would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/101773c968c60f5da85394a0a9e7d0be3bcb9e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\cdot x^2=2009,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" /> and the only possible outcome for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b17ce6fcb2994d4241d780dd5311d828db133411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />\n-Edited slightly by RealityWrites - minor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/latex.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\LaTeX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> edits by BS2012\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Partly_Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Partly_Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Partly Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Partly Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since in a geometric sequence, where there is an integer ratio, all the terms before the last one (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />) must be factors of it, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Looking at the answer choices, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d32bac8c5abe4d6b299d444f24a8055279b232.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3626ff02d0ba34a6ae1421f4b5e155992ec4cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> are not factors of 2009. For an answer to work, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e5353be8ed3b6d8af6a30a315f5614b29af464af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2009}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> has to be a perfect square (since it's the same ratio being multiplied 2 times). \n</p><p>Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec5bdc2c0e59651ee5e6fa74ba318dc73d744feb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03da64b70448a3e0ed8defa9b01f908b735c5cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2009}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/c/2dce31a5d23c586e4de53dd70d7ca80f5c278233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$287$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> (Not a perfect square.)\n</p><p>Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/988a15926640244e366e55b6e468af2e3e60047e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56ec0ba3cf81591e904dd569cdffde5d3e4dba09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2009}{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba6cdde56f366d628a7a35826f98523dbe58bd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> (Not a perfect square.)\n</p><p>Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e226c2f5a445f0a9ab589c1337336ea7587b36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f51d6533cc1d39f1682972587d5332d689952eb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2009}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"42\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> (Is a perfect square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/8/33899975156f027e48a049f25de2dae768707588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=41\\Rightarrow\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"23\" />.)\n</p><p>By: spacex_fanboy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A\">2009 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=